> - This parameter takes effect when TaskAction is set to Import.
> - This parameter is supported only in CPFS for Lingjun 2.6.0 and later.', example='false', position='Query'),
  dataFlowId: string(name='DataFlowId', description='The ID of the data flow.

This parameter is required.', example='df-194433a5be31****', position='Query'),
  dataType?: string(name='DataType', description='The type of data operated by the data flow task.

Valid values:

- Metadata: the metadata of files, including attributes such as timestamp, ownership, and permission. If you select Metadata, only the metadata of the files is imported. You can only view the files. When you access the file data, the data is loaded on demand from the source storage.
- Data: the data blocks of files.
- MetaAndData: the metadata and data blocks of files.
> When TaskAction is set to Evict, the DataType parameter is required.', example='Metadata', position='Query'),
  directory?: string(name='Directory', description='The source directory of the data.

Limits:
- The value must be 1 to 1,023 characters in length.
