- If Key is set to Description, Value is set to the description of the data flow or a part of the description.
- If Key is set to Status, Value is set to the data flow status.
- If Key is set to SourceStoragePath, Value is set to the access path of the source storage or a part of the access path. The value can be up to 1,024 characters in length.', example='FsetIds'),
